+     "tool": "banana2",
+     "modelId": "banana2",
+     "outputs": [
+       {
+         "type": "image",
+         "id": "o_xxxxxxxx",
+         "url": "https://files.dlazy.com/result.png",
+         "mimeType": "image/png"
+       }
+ > Async tasks (when `--no-wait` is passed) return `outputs: []` and a `task: { generateId, status }` field instead. Use `dlazy status <generateId> --wait` to poll.
